(c) full access to closely observe and examine all facilities, storage areas, and equipment,  and to closely observe, examine, or copy all materials, that the office determines  to be useful in conducting an audit described in this section;

(d) full access to all staff, including full-time, part-time, and volunteer staff;

(e) full access to closely observe, examine, and copy all records and information relating  to election audits that are conducted by the Office of the Lieutenant Governor, a  county clerk, or any other person;

(f) the right to, within the scope of the audit, attend any meeting, including a closed  meeting;

(g) the right to, within the scope of the audit, closely observe and examine any work  or other process; and

